// Pipe section (UnifiedPipes; README "Unified pipes"): a length of pipe, the cross-section of the
// straight pipe it becomes (Pipes and Power Expanded's: a square tube 6 voxels across with 1-voxel
// walls round a 4 x 4 bore), a block long (shapes/item/pipesection.json), textured as ppex's pipes
// are (sheet-plain/<metal>4). The draw bench draws a smaller piece in the machine (its README).
// No grid or anvil recipe makes it: copper and lead ones come from a chute section on the mandrel
// station (2) or the draw bench (4), iron and steel ones from Steelmaking Expanded's canal in the
// pipe mold (CastPipes, 2 a fill). One makes a straight ppex pipe; two, three or four a bend, T- or
// X-junction (recipes/grid/unifiedpipes.json). Marked disabled with the switch off.
